class: runtime
profiles: standard
summary: a runtime fixture with no stdin key gives its program an empty standard input on every lane, so the published word count prints three zero totals rather than waiting on the harness's own input
program: ../word-count/main.ldn
run_expect: output.txt
stream: output
status: 0
constructs: 1650, 1660
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, darwin-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
